  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.13 Cobbetts Pond. The area of Cobbetts Pond in the town of Windham, known as the Narrows, which extends 860 feet northeast from the boat ramp at 30 Horseshoe Road to a stonewall on the point on the east side of the Pond, shall be a “no wake” area.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.14); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; ss by #6560, eff 8-20-97; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.13) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
